<title>FINLAND: HK RUOKATALO SAYS LSO HAS 63 PCT OF SHRS.</title>
<headline>HK RUOKATALO SAYS LSO HAS 63 PCT OF SHRS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food group HK Ruokatalo Oy said on Thursday its main owner, cooperative , had lowered its holding in HK Ruokatalo to 63.0 percent of shares from 83.7 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;After the deals LSO's holding of HK Ruokatalo's votes is 96.1 percent,&quot; HK Ruokatalo said in a statement.</p>
</text>
